WEBVTT

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:44.810
It is what I am. I was once a man. I know the evil men do. Do not bring your evil here. I warn you, beware.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:48.340
The wrath of Swamp Thing.

00:02:16.890 --> 00:02:27.300
I'm sorry it's taken me darn near a week to look into this toxic waste.

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:29.910
I've been out of town.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:33.690
I'm receiving a very nice honorary degree from some very kind people.

00:02:34.170 --> 00:02:36.940
I don't remember what I did that so impressed them.

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:39.840
It's been four weeks since I asked for your help, Doctor.

00:02:40.060 --> 00:02:41.840
I'd like some immediate action.

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:44.080
The dumping will be stopped, my dear.

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:44.940
And the damage...

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:58.240
area will be restored. Do it with my own hands if you like. And ruin your manicure?

00:03:06.236 --> 00:03:08.836
Man, it's really a crime. People dump so much crud in this swamp.

00:03:10.780 --> 00:03:12.260
If they didn't, you'd be out of a job.

00:03:30.028 --> 00:03:30.528
Look at this.

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:39.360
Yeah.

00:03:50.924 --> 00:03:51.864
Wish I knew what it is.

00:03:52.748 --> 00:03:54.748
I bet even God doesn't know what it is.

00:03:54.988 --> 00:03:56.988
I think we should finish it off.

00:03:58.028 --> 00:03:59.868
Maybe we ought to run it past Dr. Arcane.

00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:02.860
Why bother? He says he doesn't care what we do with this stuff.

00:04:03.530 --> 00:04:07.360
In that case, I know how we can make ourselves some big bucks off of this thing.

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:42.280
Take it a free peep!

00:04:42.930 --> 00:04:43.950
I didn't see anything!

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:46.520
You can always tell when boys lie.

00:04:47.910 --> 00:04:49.030
They tighten their bums.

00:04:49.960 --> 00:04:51.480
Makes them stand funny.

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:54.360
You're standing funny right now, aren't you?

00:04:55.370 --> 00:04:56.290
I wanna buy a ticket.

00:04:57.800 --> 00:04:59.720
You got any idea what's...

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:14.570
inside my grotesquery human anomalies oh so it's human anomalies is it and what

00:05:14.760 --> 00:05:29.370
think it's gonna rain the sun's out now the sun's a cover-up

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:32.430
How'd you like to work for me?

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:35.140
Doing what?

00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:40.110
Baby, your stomach can't take a job like this, eh?

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:23.740
I hope it tastes better than it looks.

00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:49.530
this while it's hot.

00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:51.500
What's taking you so long?

00:06:58.220 --> 00:06:59.380
You filthy misfits.

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:29.970
Swamp war.

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:38.980
an algae i was once a scientist i go get some can't bring the cure to him you must take him

00:07:38.980 --> 00:07:49.800
to the cure how can i get him out of this cage i don't know how much longer i can last hurry

00:07:49.800 --> 00:07:59.100
please i'll get you back to the swamp some way

00:08:00.510 --> 00:08:00.990
I promise.

00:08:01.310 --> 00:08:15.340
Want to be gone long?

00:08:15.710 --> 00:08:16.710
Why, are you going to miss me?

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:18.180
Just do your work.

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:18.960
You mind your own business.

00:09:00.730 --> 00:09:03.670
My place would look good to you after sleeping in the streets.

00:09:03.990 --> 00:09:09.840
You look almost pretty when you're afraid.

00:09:10.120 --> 00:09:11.600
I'm not afraid. I'm hungry.

00:09:12.250 --> 00:09:13.550
You said you'd buy me a hot meal.

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:17.000
I have some soggy potato chips around here somewhere.

00:09:17.810 --> 00:09:19.740
You can have them, if you can find them.

00:09:29.660 --> 00:09:29.960
Say hi to...

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:45.090
you get to be a homeless? It fell through the cracks. Come over here. Let me go! Oh what?

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:52.460
You'll scream? You'll scream bloody murder! Nobody around here to hear you. Nobody except

00:09:52.460 --> 00:09:54.610
those misbegotten's out there.

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:01.320
I'm sure they'd like to meet you!

00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:44.820
Meet Lady Claire, gentlemen.

00:10:45.140 --> 00:10:45.960
